{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BECOME THE SCUFF SLAYER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974570/extras/76492d0c3fdd28638f7830c3f26ac985.avif?t=1759201209\" width=616 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of the Scuff Slayer, a messed-up kid forced to join the army in a post-apocalyptic world where the Scuffs have taken over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Scuffs. Malicious creatures born from the oversimplification of humanity\u2014an event known as the <i>Scuff Invasion</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scuffs are capable of anything\u2026 but you are the Scuff Slayer, the one destined to save humankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this top-down pixel art game, you\u2019ll face relentless hordes of enemies while uncovering the epic story of the Scuff Slayer and his allies. Face the False God, and discover that the true enemy goes beyond life itself\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WALK THE PATH OF THE SOLDIER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974570/extras/3f61defa0eda5a27b2df5b620da77f02.avif?t=1759201209\" width=616 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the apocalyptic world of the <i>Scuff Invasion</i>, those who master the power of the core of reality\u2014bending it with 1s and 0s through inspiration and expiration\u2014rise above the rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock unique and innovative abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to throw a flip-flop? You can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to drive a car? You can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974570/extras/76e5b0438055838437203586c2e8bff7.avif?t=1759201209\" width=616 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to spark an\u2026 industrial revolution?! You can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to fight a bee in a\u2026 suit\u2026?! You can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want popcorn (digital)? You\u2019re a friend, so of course we\u2019ve got it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost every absurd idea exists in the world of the Scuffs\u2014and YOU will be the one to uncover them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And discover the secrets of the past\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ALL THINGS MUST COME TO AN END.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974570/extras/36ae8b1289d914d996370f78a55f6041.avif?t=1759201209\" width=616 height=400 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Binary Respiration","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3974570/61bfcbb8f2cd9abb04a0344e64c1c2033d2d7bd3.jpg"},{"name":"The Young Soldier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3974570/61bfcbb8f2cd9abb04a0344e64c1c2033d2d7bd3.jpg"},{"name":"Training","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3974570/61bfcbb8f2cd9abb04a0344e64c1c2033d2d7bd3.jpg"},{"name":"First Mission... When's Vacation?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3974570/61bfcbb8f2cd9abb04a0344e64c1c2033d2d7bd3.jpg"},{"name":"God?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3974570/61bfcbb8f2cd9abb04a0344e64c1c2033d2d7bd3.jpg"},{"name":"Christmas Bird","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3974570/61bfcbb8f2cd9abb04a0344e64c1c2033d2d7bd3.jpg"},{"name":" The Alpha...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.stea